## About the standard

IEC 60364-1 sets out fundamental safety principles for low-voltage electrical installations and introduces the assessment of general installation characteristics. Part 1 provides the framework for the rest of the series.

Design work also requires the relevant parts of the series and applicable national rules. The 2025 edition replaces the previous 2005 edition.

Official source: [IEC 60364-1:2025](https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/63699).
